# Optional: the Playroom gameId from https://dev.joinplayroom.com. Copy to .env.production.local.
# It's only used by production builds (npm run build / preview); the dev server never uses it, so
# local testing doesn't eat into the free plan's daily users. The live site gets it from the
# VITE_PLAYROOM_GAME_ID repository variable on GitHub.
VITE_PLAYROOM_GAME_ID=
